---@class aws.marketplace_catalog.ListAssessmentsRequest
---@field Catalog aws.marketplace_catalog.Catalog The catalog related to the request. Fixed value: AWSMarketplace
---@field FrameworkId? aws.marketplace_catalog.FrameworkId The unique identifier of a framework. When specified, only assessments performed against this framework are returned. For example, AMISecurity.
---@field AssessmentTargetFilter? aws.marketplace_catalog.AssessmentTargetFilter Filters the list of assessments to those performed against a specific entity or change set.
---@field FrameworkFilters? aws.marketplace_catalog.FrameworkFilters Framework-specific filters. Set exactly one member to filter results to assessments performed against that framework.
---@field MaxResults? aws.marketplace_catalog.ListAssessmentsMaxResultInteger Specifies the upper limit of the elements on a single page. If a value isn't provided, the default value is 20. Valid values range from 1 to 100.
---@field NextToken? aws.marketplace_catalog.NextToken The value of the next token, if it exists. null if there are no more results.

---@class aws.marketplace_catalog.ListAssessmentsResponse
---@field AssessmentSummaryList aws.marketplace_catalog.AssessmentSummaryList An array of AssessmentSummary objects.
---@field NextToken? aws.marketplace_catalog.NextToken The value of the next token, if it exists. null if there are no more results.

---@alias aws.marketplace_catalog.ListChangeSetsMaxResultInteger number

---@class aws.marketplace_catalog.ListChangeSetsRequest
---@field Catalog aws.marketplace_catalog.Catalog The catalog related to the request. Fixed value: AWSMarketplace
---@field FilterList? aws.marketplace_catalog.FilterList An array of filter objects.
---@field Sort? aws.marketplace_catalog.Sort An object that contains two attributes, SortBy and SortOrder.
---@field MaxResults? aws.marketplace_catalog.ListChangeSetsMaxResultInteger The maximum number of results returned by a single call. This value must be provided in the next call to retrieve the next set of results. By default, this value is 20.
---@field NextToken? aws.marketplace_catalog.NextToken The token value retrieved from a previous call to access the next page of results.

---@class aws.marketplace_catalog.ListChangeSetsResponse
---@field ChangeSetSummaryList aws.marketplace_catalog.ChangeSetSummaryList Array of ChangeSetSummaryListItem objects.
---@field NextToken? aws.marketplace_catalog.NextToken The value of the next token, if it exists. Null if there are no more results.

---@alias aws.marketplace_catalog.ListEntitiesMaxResultInteger number

---@class aws.marketplace_catalog.ListEntitiesRequest
---@field Catalog aws.marketplace_catalog.Catalog The catalog related to the request. Fixed value: AWSMarketplace
---@field EntityType aws.marketplace_catalog.EntityType The type of entities to retrieve. Valid values are: AmiProduct, ContainerProduct, DataProduct, SaaSProduct, ProcurementPolicy, Experience, Audience, BrandingSettings, Offer, OfferSet, Seller, ResaleAuthorization, Solution, SubsidiaryAuthorization.
---@field FilterList? aws.marketplace_catalog.FilterList An array of filter objects. Each filter object contains two attributes, filterName and filterValues.
---@field Sort? aws.marketplace_catalog.Sort An object that contains two attributes, SortBy and SortOrder.
---@field NextToken? aws.marketplace_catalog.NextToken The value of the next token, if it exists. Null if there are no more results.
---@field MaxResults? aws.marketplace_catalog.ListEntitiesMaxResultInteger Specifies the upper limit of the elements on a single page. If a value isn't provided, the default value is 20.
---@field OwnershipType? aws.marketplace_catalog.OwnershipType|string Filters the returned set of entities based on their owner. The default is SELF. To list entities shared with you through AWS Resource Access Manager (AWS RAM), set to SHARED. Entities shared through the AWS Marketplace Catalog API PutResourcePolicy operation can't be discovered through the SHARED parameter.
---@field EntityTypeFilters? aws.marketplace_catalog.EntityTypeFilters A Union object containing filter shapes for all EntityTypes. Each EntityTypeFilter shape will have filters applicable for that EntityType that can be used to search or filter entities.
---@field EntityTypeSort? aws.marketplace_catalog.EntityTypeSort A Union object containing Sort shapes for all EntityTypes. Each EntityTypeSort shape will have SortBy and SortOrder applicable for fields on that EntityType. This can be used to sort the results of the filter query.

---@class aws.marketplace_catalog.ListEntitiesResponse
---@field EntitySummaryList aws.marketplace_catalog.EntitySummaryList Array of EntitySummary objects.
---@field NextToken? aws.marketplace_catalog.NextToken The value of the next token if it exists. Null if there is no more result.

